From 028a0ad0ed6711e39fc584d55be8a987906a81c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:15:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(waterjet): add machine and nozzle kinds with
 validated cut data

Declare XY waterjet machines with optional Z and named spindle refusals.
Preserve material/thickness recipes through tools, projects and UI commands.
Check XY travel and feed while refusing incompatible operations and posts.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1881
